
  THE MUSIC OF THE PRIMES

======================================================================

  PIECE 1: PRIME HARMONY
  Each prime = a tone. Frequency = rapidity. Amplitude = 1/sqrt(p).
  This IS the explicit formula for pi(x), made audible.

  Generating 8s of prime music at 22050Hz...
  Using 46 primes up to 199.

